# Normalize line endings: store LF in the repo, check out the platform-native
# ending (CRLF on Windows for .ps1/.vbs, LF elsewhere). This avoids the classic
# "PowerShell script has a bad line-ending" failure when cloning on Windows.
* text=auto

# Binary / generated: never convert or diff.
*.safetensors binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.whl  binary
*.tgz  binary
